To {!Contact.FirstName},

Your agreement for the purchase and sale of future receivables with {!advpm__Matter__c.Originating_Lender__c} has recently charged off. The amount due is {!advpm__Matter__c.Total_Amount_Charged_Off__c}. We understand that there could be many reasons why you were unable to perform and therefore wanted to reach out to see if you were interested in working out a payment plan without having to proceed with possible litigation.

Please feel free to call and/or email us to discuss further.

Thank you,

